    "sub": "Fine work heals fast but fades if it’s rushed. Here is what to do for the first three weeks.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "when": "Day 1",
        "n": "Film stays on",
        "d": "Keep the second-skin film on for 24 hours, then peel it off slowly under warm running water."
      },
      {
        "when": "Days 2 to 7",
        "n": "Wash and balm",
        "d": "Wash twice a day with unscented soap and add a very thin layer of balm. Less is more."
      },
      {
        "when": "Week 3",
        "n": "Settled",
        "d": "It will look a little soft as it heals, then sharpen up. Send us a photo if anything looks patchy."
